OL,3,AAbout 280 people evacuated after fire
OL,4,Aat seaside hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said the blaze was
OL,7,Fbelieved to have started in the
OL,8,Fbasement of the building, adding that
OL,9,Fthe cause was not yet known. No
OL,10,Ffire-related injuries have been
OL,11,Freported.
